  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$10.723$（$10.723=3.51+7.213$）.在$10.723$中，哪些数字是",
        "可靠数字呢？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了回答这个问题，我们要应用界限法."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因为"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$3.507\\leqslant x\\leqslant3.513$，",
        "$7.2126\\leqslant y\\leqslant7.2134$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "所以"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$10.7196\\leqslant x+y\\leqslant10.7264$，即$x+y=10.723\\pm0.0034$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们看到，两个界的算术平均数与两个近似数的和完全",
        "相同."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由等式$x+y=10.723\\pm0.0034$可知，在和的近似数",
        "$10.723$中，第一个可靠数字（从右边算起）是百分位数字.这",
        "就是说，$x$与$y$的近似数相加时，它们的和在小数点后有两个",
        "可靠数字，也就是与精确程度较低的那个近似数的可靠数字",
        "个数相同."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地，所有数字都是可靠数字的两个近似数相加时，在",
        "大多数情形下，它们之中小数位数较少的近似数有几位，它们",
        "的和的小数部分的可靠数字就有几个."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在具体计算中，通常应用下述法则：所有数字都是可靠",
        "数字的近似数相加时，其中小数位数最少的近似数有几个数",
        "位，它们的和就保留几个小数数位."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "用这种方法进行计算时，如果已知近似数的个数不太多，",
        "那么可能除了末位数外，所得结果全部是可靠数字."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "显然，为了计算简单起见，位数过多的各近似数可以先适",
        "当地四舍五入.四舍五入时，各近似数要比准确度最低的近"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "169"
      ]
    }
  ]
